{% set local_problem %}
<p>Many older Elkmont homes have fascia damage hiding behind their gutters. When gutters clog and overflow, water runs behind them and soaks into the fascia boards. In Alabama's humid climate, that moisture creates perfect conditions for rot. The damage often goes unnoticed until gutters start sagging or pulling away.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>We inspect fascia and soffit for damage, remove rotted sections back to solid wood, and install new boards. Everything is properly sealed and prepared for gutter installation. You get a complete solution from one contractor.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set why_us %}
<p>We handle both carpentry and gutter installation, which means better coordination and a single point of accountability. When we're done, your home is fully protected — backed by our warranty and reputation.</p>
{% endset %}
